# {{project_name}} Knowledge

This index is the machine and human entry point for reusable project knowledge.

## Categories

- `glossary/` — project terminology
- `business-rules/` — durable product rules
- `user-flows/` — user and system flows
- `architecture/` — system boundaries and dependencies
- `interfaces/` — API and integration contracts
- `data-model/` — durable data structures
- `test-strategy/` — reusable test guidance
- `operations/` — runtime and operational knowledge

Registered sources are listed in `_sources.yaml`. Unresolved or unconfirmed
background belongs in `_gaps.md`, not in confirmed knowledge pages.

